Package: scans
Title: Analyze AI Agent Trajectories
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("James", "Wade", , "github@jameshwade.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools to import, inspect, scan, and validate trajectories
    produced by artificial intelligence agents built with 'ellmer' and related
    R packages. Complements outcome evaluation with post-run analysis of
    messages, tool calls, events, and multi-agent execution.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://jameshwade.github.io/scans/,
    https://github.com/JamesHWade/scans
BugReports: https://github.com/JamesHWade/scans/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2.0)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
